    signature:'The core message “big and small” becomes a recurring composition rule across otherwise varied worlds.', signatureRu:'Сообщение «big and small» превращено в повторяемое композиционное правило для разных миров.',
    transferable:'Use when a service proposition can become a repeated visual contrast—fast/slow, global/local, complex/simple, big/small.', transferableRu:'Использовать, когда сервисное обещание можно превратить в повторяемый визуальный контраст: fast/slow, global/local, complex/simple, big/small.',
    variables:{brandPromise:'one two-part service promise', contrast:'a clear visual contrast representing it', worlds:'several environments that can repeat the same contrast', payoff:'a quiet human/service outcome'},
    porterPrompt:`Translate {{brandPromise}} into the recurring visual contrast {{contrast}}. Generate separate clean clips rather than one overloaded sequence. Shot 1: fixed or single-move image that makes the contrast readable immediately. Shot 2: repeat the same compositional rule in the first of {{worlds}}. Shot 3: repeat it in a second world while preserving tone, camera grammar and subject anchors. Shot 4: quiet {{payoff}} with minimal camera movement. Visual style: premium global-service film, wonder balanced by realism. Constraints: one visual idea per shot, stable anatomy/objects, no random style resets. Use editing, cleanup, color and sound to unify the generated worlds.`
