    sourceExcerpt:'Actors’ performances were captured on set and then extended into AI-constructed worlds, preserving subtle shifts in movement, gesture and expression.', sourceExcerptRu:'Актёрские performance captured on set затем расширяли в AI-миры, сохраняя тонкие движения, жесты и мимику.',
